Morning Cura, Not sure what to say in response to this.  I know that *I* don't really have a clue as to what hours you play.  I've seen you log on and then back off in less than an hour many times.  /shrug  Maybe if I knew what your schedule was we could have done some things together, 2 necros kill stuff fast.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  As far as Div13 not being able to do the things you want, what *are* the things you want?  Leaving without talking about the issues at hand confuses me just a bit.  If nobody knew what the problem was, how were we supposed to address it?<P>If you're looking to join an "uber" guild, I've got a couple pieces of advice for you, gleaned from my time in EQ.<BR>1.  Level 50+ necros/druids are a dime a dozen and not wanted very badly.<BR>2.  Most "uber" guilds that i've seen don't tag anybody lower than level 55-56.<BR>3.  Most "uber" guilds have pretty serious standards for even being considered.  Read as:  Must have seb key, howling stones key, full resist gear (BDiamond preferred), all spells, etc etc.<P>While I have no clue of the big guilds on Bertox, having only been there for a month, I'm sure most of what I've said will apply to them.  Even if you have a "friend" on the inside of one of those guilds, they don't tag unless you meet their requirements.  <P>I've thought about joining a larger, more established/powerful guild, most likely anybody level 50+ has done the same thing.  I haven't done it because I came to this server to be with my friends.  But, if I get to the high-50s and still havent done some of the things I'd like to do, then I'll probably start shopping around.  It's just a fact of life.  As you get into the high-end game, you want to do some of the high-end stuff.  When that doesn't happen you either get bored and quit, or find a high-end guild to join.  My list of things to do on Bertox?  See Below.<P>1.  Kill Trakanon, The Dain, Yelinak<BR>2.  Hunt in Western Wastes, deep inside Dragon Necropolis, Temple of Veeshan, Skyshrine<BR>3.  Hit level 60<BR>4.  Get my Kael quest armor<BR>5.  Kill Woushi<BR>6.  Kill lots more stuff  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 54th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Bertox. Server<P>Sendil- 50th Level Rogue<BR>Solusek Ro Server
